=== 4. PRIMARY test: permutation null (1000 repeats; labels shuffled independently in each cohort; screen + LASSO rerun) ===
completed in 5.5 min
null overlap-size distribution:

  0   1 
991   9 
null: mean overlap 0.009, max 1; null LASSO set size islet mean 4.11 (empty in 54.2%), adipose mean 2.78 (empty in 47.9%)
observed overlap 0; count(null >= observed) = 1000; empirical p = (1000 + 1) / 1001 = 1.0000
NOTE: with an observed overlap of 0, every null value satisfies null >= 0, so p = 1 by construction; the test has no power to detect anything when the observed overlap is empty.
NOTE: the observed adipose LASSO selection is empty (lambda.1se removes every gene), so the observed overlap cannot be > 0 whatever the islet selection.

